# ==============================================================================
# 1. Local Agent Reference & Scratch Sandbox (_reference/)
# ==============================================================================
# Two-stage Git lifecycle:
# - Stage A (Template repo): Track _reference/AGENTS.md, _reference/SPEC.md, and
#   empty repos/.gitkeep + assets/.gitkeep markers so cloning this template on any
#   laptop or VM provides the reference workspace ready to use. Ignore anything else.
# - Stage B (Initialized project): `init_project.py` runs `git rm --cached -r _reference/`
#   and replaces this block with `_reference/` so private specs, cloned reference
#   repos, and raw assets are 100% ignored in the target project's repository.
_reference/*
!_reference/AGENTS.md
!_reference/SPEC.md
!_reference/repos/
_reference/repos/*
!_reference/repos/.gitkeep
!_reference/assets/
_reference/assets/*
!_reference/assets/.gitkeep

# ==============================================================================
# 2. Environment & Secrets
# ==============================================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
credentials.json
secrets.*

# ==============================================================================
# 3. Universal Build, Coverage, Editor & OS Artifacts
# ==============================================================================
dist/
build/
out/
coverage/
tmp/
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agent Ephemeral State & Verification Evidence
.agents/current_state.md
.agents/state_history.jsonl
.agents/verification_evidence.json
.agents/REPO_MAP.md
.agents/arch_graph.json
.agents/SKILL_PROPOSALS.md
.agents/radar_seen.json

# ==============================================================================
# 4. Stack-Specific Ignores (Populated from _catalog/stacks/*/gitignore.fragment)
# ==============================================================================
